# Cost of the same integer expressions under every built-in microarchitectural model.
# gt1030 / GPU models first, then the x86 models (skl, skx, glc, rpl, zen2, zen4, x86v*).
addc(x: u32) = x + 11
mulc(x: u32) = x * 7
divc(x: u32) = x / 7
divv(x: u32, y: u32) = x / y
remv(x: u32, y: u32) = x % y
shl(x: u32) = x << 3
logic(x: u32, y: u32) = (x & y) | (x xor y)
select(x: u32, y: u32) = x < y ? x : y
cost addc model gt1030
cost addc model zen4
cost addc model skl
cost addc model glc
cost addc model x86v4
cost mulc model gt1030
cost mulc model zen4
cost mulc model skl
cost mulc model glc
cost mulc model x86v4
cost divc model gt1030
cost divc model zen4
cost divc model skl
cost divc model glc
cost divv model gt1030
cost divv model zen4
cost divv model skl
cost divv model glc
cost remv model gt1030
cost remv model zen4
cost remv model skl
cost shl model gt1030
cost shl model zen4
cost shl model skl
cost logic model gt1030
cost logic model zen4
cost logic model skl
cost select model gt1030
cost select model zen4
cost select model skl
